# `vilan build .` writes the emitted JavaScript beside the source it came
# from, and `vilan run .` refreshes any style sidecar the same way. Generated
# output is not checked in.
*.mjs
*.css
# `dist/` holds what the build records for itself — today the `[[build.hook]]`
# freshness stamp. Deleting it re-runs every hook, which is the point.
dist/
